	"Description": "\n<br />[b][size=5]How to Use[/size][/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]Requirements:[/b]\n<br />• [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9246]Alternative Textures[/url]\n<br />\n<br />1. Install the required mods and Chest Deco.\n<br />2. Place a chest like normal.\n<br />3. Buy the Paint Bucket from Robin's shop (added by Alternative Textures).\n<br />4. Use the Paint Bucket on your chest to browse and apply different looks.\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=5]Updating[/size][/b]\n<br />\n<br />Just delete the old Chest Deco folder and replace it with the new one. Your save should be fine, but making a backup is always a good idea.\n<br />\n<br />Hope you enjoy it!\n<br />\n<br />[i]Got an idea or found a bug? Feel free to leave a comment. I'd love to hear your suggestions![/i]\n<br />",
